# Angles. A degree is `45°`, and degrees, minutes and seconds of arc are
# written together, `45°30′30″` (`º`, `'` and `"` do for `°`, `′` and `″`).
# The radian `rad` is the unit of an angle, a steradian `sr` is a radian
# squared, and a lumen `lm` and a lux `lx` need it. An angle is a dimension of
# its own, so a frequency in `Hz` and a speed of turning in `rad.s^-1` are not
# mixed up.
#
# `sin`, `cos` and `tan` take an angle in any unit and work in radians; `dms`
# writes an angle out as degrees, minutes and seconds.

sheet Literals

| Name         | Value          |
| ------------ | -------------- |
| degrees      | 45°            |
| minutes      | 45°30′         |
| seconds      | 45°30′30″      |
| ascii        | 45º30'30"      |
| decimal      | 45°30.5′       |
| radians      | 1.5707963rad   |
| angular speed | 2rad.s^-1     |
| solid angle  | 2sr            |
| luminous flux | 800lm         |
| illuminance  | 500lx          |
| celsius      | 20°C           |

sheet Arithmetic

| Name           | Value                        |
| -------------- | ---------------------------- |
| sum            | = 45° + 0.5rad               |
| difference     | = 90° - 30°30′               |
| in radians     | = 180°.to('rad')             |
| in seconds     | = 1°.to('″')                 |
| equal          | = 45°30′ == 45.5°            |
| sine           | = sin(30°)                   |
| cosine         | = cos(60°)                   |
| tangent        | = tan(45°)                   |
| uncertain sine | = sin(30.0(5)°)              |
| written out    | = 45.508333333°.dms(1)       |
| a radian       | = dms(1rad)                  |
| illuminance    | = (800lm / 2m^2).to('lx')    |

# A column of angles is shown in the unit it names, `Angle[°]`, whatever the
# cells were written in, and a bare number is read in it.
sheet Bearings

Place   : String
Bearing : Angle[°]
Radians : Angle
Written : String

| Place    | Bearing  | Radians | Written |
| -------- | -------- | ------- | ------- |
| north    | 0°       | *       | *       |
| east     | 90°      | *       | *       |
| south    | 3.14159rad | *     | *       |
| lookout  | 120°30′  | *       | *       |
| summit   | 45.5     | *       | *       |

Radians := Bearing.to('rad')
Written := Bearing.dms()
